            Example usage:
            For a sample {@link MlAtomicPipe} created using Linear Regression in Sklearn:
            lr_pipe = c3.MlPipe.convert(native_lr)
            updated_lr_pipe = lr_pipe.withHyperparams({'fit_intercept': False})
            
